SpawnAlliedJeep local.entSpawnTarget local.strTargetname local.strDriverHag local.strFrontRiderHag local.intGunnerRiders local.strGunnerRidersHag:
//
//	Spawn an allied jeep with optional driver and riders
//	All these passed in values can be set on the spawntarget entity as well (see below).
//	To use the values set on the spawntarget entity, pass a "" value into the
//	optional parameters.  This will also work with the strTargetname value as well.
